  "scope_note": "The six root production sources and six test sources form one complete package. Every additional module artifact, including z platform/allocator variants, sim and its gzip fixture, contrib examples, CI/lint/build inputs and benchmark figures, is inventoried as support or a separate package; none is silently accepted as transcreated.",
  "dependency_contracts": {
    "z": "Bloom, KeyToHash and HistogramData production helpers; allocator functions in original tests. Runtime hashing/assembly, platform mmap, 32/64-bit and jemalloc variants require a separate complete-package decision.",
    "sim": "Stress tests use Zipfian generator and clairvoyant helper in stress_test.go; gli.lirs.gz belongs to sim test/trace support.",
    "third_party": "Source imports xxhash, farm, humanize, glog, errors, testify and x/sys selected through TiDB master; module go.mod/go.sum also retained in inventory."
  },
  "reviewed_production_contracts": [
    "cache.go: buffered nonresident admission, resident eager update, dropped set/update distinction, callback ownership, FIFO Wait, Clear/Close, TTL and policy metrics",
    "policy.go: TinyLFU doorkeeper/four-bit sketch, sampled eviction, reject and partial-victim behavior, frequency worker and dynamic costs",
    "ring.go: lossy read-frequency batches and pooled stripes",
    "sketch.go: four nibble rows, random xor seeds, saturation, halving/reset",
    "store.go: 256 shared map shards, hash conflicts, expiration and callback clear",
    "ttl.go: five-second bucket assignment, cleanup and expiration-map update"
  ],
  "integration_decision": "Existing Stretto 0.9.0 remains an explicitly unaccepted dependency. A deterministic paused-worker test proves eager primary publication, so a TinyLFU name or pressure-only fix cannot certify compatibility. No new partial cache implementation is integrated.",
  "native_test_mapping": "Native replacement of all 73 original dependency tests, five benchmarks, helper fixtures and build variants is pending. Original Go package is executed directly under race; this inventory is not a transcreation receipt.",
  "validation_receipt": "lfu-review-followup.md"
}
